      "text": "GroupInfo: \nThis information needs to be either persisted OR the\nlogic to generate this needs to be kept consistent\nbetween the point when they are generated and when\nit is sent to XProduct.\n- MKMS: contentId\n- XKMS: contentId_versionId (underscore delimiter)",
